{"title":"Sand Wyrmling","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 44 Sand Wyrm that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 4 times (2.3% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/deathstalker-venom\">Deathstalker Venom</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrmling\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrmling?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>181</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrmling?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>248</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrmling?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>181</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrmling?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>248</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 24 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wyrm-tooth\" title=\"Wyrm Tooth - in 19 of 24 looted corpses, 15 recorded drops, 16 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/20d4d609ca4b783a9215.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wyrm Tooth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wyrm-hide\" title=\"Wyrm Hide - in 16 of 24 looted corpses, 12 recorded drops, 12 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/97b6093fa51dfdf6f46d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wyrm Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 3 recorded drops, 189 total, 25–133 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×25–133</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"black-walnut-longbow\" title=\"Black Walnut Longbow - in 2 of 24 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/461e1d81d69de0d42fea.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Black Walnut Longbow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/12<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wyrm-pearl\" title=\"Wyrm Pearl - in 2 of 24 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2eee2bf87300eb446f29.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wyrm Pearl</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/12<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-dagger\" title=\"Titanium Dagger - in 1 of 24 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/76a2e17f4e9945d67b1f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/24<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"wyrm-tooth\" title=\"Wyrm Tooth - in 19 of 24 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 10 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/20d4d609ca4b783a9215.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wyrm Tooth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"wyrm-hide\" title=\"Wyrm Hide - in 16 of 24 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 9 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/97b6093fa51dfdf6f46d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wyrm Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 1 of 24 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/24<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(229.5px,-1557.4px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/-2/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/-2/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/-1/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/-1/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:1536px\"><i style=\"left:-306.6px;top:1502.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-225.5px;top:1528.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:-189.7px;top:1536.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-163.6px;top:1581.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:-221.4px;top:1545.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:-235.1px;top:1574.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:-53.6px;top:1640.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:-214.5px;top:1553.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-242.0px;top:1524.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:-251.6px;top:1516.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-264.0px;top:1542.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-204.9px;top:1562.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:-143.0px;top:1572.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:-203.5px;top:1592.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-217.2px;top:1546.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:-191.1px;top:1588.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-276.4px;top:1563.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:-276.4px;top:1516.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-152.6px;top:1586.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:-107.2px;top:1602.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-195.2px;top:1580.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-220.0px;top:1584.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:-214.5px;top:1521.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:-188.4px;top:1568.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-193.9px;top:1590.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-225.5px;top:1520.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-244.7px;top:1502.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:-200.7px;top:1576.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:-138.9px;top:1597.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:-236.5px;top:1546.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:-270.9px;top:1534.5p